 plotted normalised to a peak of 1.0 (cyan about 650 nm, magenta about 550 nm, yellow about 440 nm); the plot has no minimum-density or neutral curve. Traced from 405 nm (c, m, y) up to 700 nm for c, 660 nm for m and about 580 nm for y: beyond that the m and y curves are below about 0.015 and lie inside the bottom frame line of the plot, so they are not traced.","No grain data, D-min values or log H reference are printed in this sheet."]}